{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05PT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$H : \\mathcal{I} \\to \\mathcal{J}$", "MATH_0003": "$H$", "MATH_0004": "$M : \\mathcal{J} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$M \\circ H$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cofinal-essentially-constant}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:17b2def93ba331de0ef5dd549773d69b99fd611bcc5f67c28e5f0cf7b0d933d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3235ded59a1945a011fac97c3d58bca54e86e01987cd4d2c2cd10f26ed79226c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a functor of filtered index categories. If <MATH_0003> is cofinal, then\nany diagram <MATH_0004> is essentially constant\nif and only if <MATH_0005> is essentially constant.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b43666915d0676b00dd61ef642c7ad83a5b4d0882f0bd1f109cb0098c200d65a", "unit_id": "tag:0A1S:statement"}
